{"title":"I Used To Be The Boss","synopsis":"Baphomet bos dari Tower of Abyss\n\n\nmenunggu seorang hunter kuat yang mampu bertarung setara melawannya\n\n\nKetika dia sudah bosan dengan pertempuran yang berulangulang dia mulai tertarik pada dunia manusia karena Goblet  yang dia peroleh dari para hunter yang mati\n\n\nPada saat yang sama ia semakin terpesona oleh keberadaan manusia ketika hunter kuat yang selalu ia harapkan muncul di hadapannya\n\n\nPada akhirnya Baphomet mencoba untuk menjadi seorang manusia","alternative_title":"보스였음","author":"Lucks","artist":"Lucks","genres":["Action","Adventure","Demon","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"43edb544-2590-4c3a-9ecc-fd0a32a66631","number":"130","title":"Chapter 130","date":"2026-01-19","images":[]},{"id":"cd92ad0b-253b-4fa1-bc6a-cd52e369a3b8","number":"129","title":"Chapter 129","date":"2026-01-05","images":[]},{"id":"5bd1ae54-0d69-4ca9-81bf-a526b37bb6ec","number":"128","title":"Chapter 128","date":"2025-12-23","images":[]},{"id":"24e3ba5a-ed65-4e01-b067-ba430e5d2cb8","number":"127","title":"Chapter 127","date":"2025-12-17","images":[]},{"id":"1237ea6f-c026-484c-af51-b7df2947cb77","number":"126","title":"Chapter 126","date":"2025-11-20","images":[]},{"id":"d5b62dd9-0260-4a2a-ad20-8afcac7dec79","number":"125","title":"Chapter 125","date":"2025-11-02","images":[]},{"id":"3ff2a27d-4948-40bb-b68e-215a8122415c","number":"124","title":"Chapter 124","date":"2025-10-25","images":[]},{"id":"1623a041-4761-4ff6-9718-20b00a10ef3c","number":"123","title":"Chapter 123","date":"2025-10-22","images":[]},{"id":"ba99f2ca-d73f-42c8-a2f7-b01ab24c4de2","number":"122","title":"Chapter 122","date":"2025-10-09","images":[]},{"id":"87bd98b7-bcc3-465a-85ca-d5d4498dd8c8","number":"121","title":"Chapter 121","date":"2025-10-03","images":[]},{"id":"ed6129d7-2db3-4581-9a4b-96deae436e15","number":"120","title":"Chapter 120","date":"2025-09-28","images":[]},{"id":"5831d56f-c3cb-4179-b40f-b461e1c1b254","number":"119","title":"Chapter 119","date":"2025-09